     1207               assign
     1208                 buf_temp-browse-handle.browse-handle :height = buf_temp-browse-handle.original-size
     1209               .
     1210             end.
     1211             for each buf_temp-diasize-handle
     1212             on error undo, next
     1213             :
     1214               assign
     1215                 v-object-handle = buf_temp-diasize-handle.handle-value
     1216               .
